                                <td colspan="3"><span class="style3"><strong>**</strong>  &#8212;  ICSE 2023 members will rotate off the Steering Committee at the end of the meeting at ICSE 2026</span>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            </tfoot>
                        </table>
                        <p>&nbsp;</p></td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            <br/>
            &nbsp;<br/></td>
    </tr>
